---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { BASE } from '../lib/constants';
---

<Base
  title="Final Project: Introduction to AI in Medicine"
  description="Student final project: explore a clinically relevant question using AI methods."
>

  <section class="section-band">
    <div class="content-col reveal-on-scroll">
      <p class="section-label">Capstone</p>
      <h1>Final Project</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-ink-secondary max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        A culminating assignment where you apply the concepts from this course to explore
        a clinically relevant question using AI methods.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-band-alt">
    <div class="content-col reveal-on-scroll max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-[17px] text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Choose a clinical domain that interests you, such as diagnostic imaging, clinical decision support,
        drug discovery, patient stratification, or any other area where AI is making an impact.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your project should demonstrate understanding of the Four Pillars framework: data quality,
        model selection, evaluation metrics, and clinical integration feasibility.
      </p>
      <p>
        You'll produce a written report and a brief presentation, following the deliverable guidelines
        outlined below.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-band">
    <div class="content-col reveal-on-scroll">
      <h3 class="mb-8">Deliverables</h3>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-ink/5 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold text-ink flex-shrink-0">1</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Written Report</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[15px] text-ink-secondary">8–12 pages, covering background, methodology, results, and critical analysis.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-ink/5 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold text-ink flex-shrink-0">2</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Presentation</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[15px] text-ink-secondary">10-minute presentation with slides to peers and faculty.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-ink/5 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-semibold text-ink flex-shrink-0">3</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">Bibliography</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[15px] text-ink-secondary">Minimum 10 peer-reviewed sources, properly cited.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a
          href={`${BASE}/Final%20Project%20Deliverables.docx`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-rule text-ink px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[15px] no-underline hover:border-ink transition-colors"
        >
          Download Full Rubric ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-band-alt">
    <div class="content-col reveal-on-scroll">
      <h3 class="mb-8">Student Examples</h3>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-ink-secondary mb-8">
        Previous student projects, included here for inspiration and to help you gauge expected scope.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <a
          href={`${BASE}/Student%20Final%20Project%20Examples/Future%20Internist%20Final%20Project.docx`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block border border-rule rounded-xl p-6 no-underline hover:border-ink transition-colors"
        >
          <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Future Internist: AI in General Internal Medicine</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-ink-secondary">
            Proposes an AI model that draws on longitudinal labs, medications, comorbidities, and imaging
            reports to predict an individual cirrhosis patient's one- and three-year risk of developing
            hepatocellular carcinoma. Rather than screening every patient on the same fixed six-month
            schedule, the model would let clinicians tailor surveillance intensity to each patient's actual
            risk, drawing on data across all major causes of cirrhosis rather than a single disease subtype.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a
          href={`${BASE}/Student%20Final%20Project%20Examples/Future%20Neurologist%20Final%20Project.docx`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block border border-rule rounded-xl p-6 no-underline hover:border-ink transition-colors"
        >
          <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Future Neurologist: AI in Neurology</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-ink-secondary">
            Proposes a model that combines MRI, EEG, and clinical variables to predict which stroke
            patients are at elevated risk of developing seizures. By integrating imaging, electrophysiology,
            and clinical context instead of relying on a single data type, the approach aims to improve on
            existing single-modality risk scores and help guide monitoring and anti-seizure medication
            decisions.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* AI Rollout Scenario */}
  <section class="section-band">
    <div class="content-col reveal-on-scroll">
      <h3 class="mb-8">AI Rollout Scenario Workshop</h3>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-ink-secondary max-w-2xl mb-8">
        A structured exercise for thinking through the practical challenges of deploying an AI system
        in a real clinical setting, covering workflow integration, stakeholder buy-in, monitoring, and safety.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href={`${BASE}/AI%20Rollout%20Scenario/AI%20Rollout%20Scenario%20Worksheet%20-%20Student.docx`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-rule text-ink px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[15px] no-underline hover:border-ink transition-colors"
        >
          Student Worksheet ↗
        </a>
        <a
          href={`${BASE}/AI%20Rollout%20Scenario/Actor%20Handout.docx`}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-rule text-ink px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[15px] no-underline hover:border-ink transition-colors"
        >
          Actor Handout ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
